Qt 6.11.1 (qtbase) — fix crash tearing the 2nd-to-last dock out of a floating
tabbed group (QDockWidgetGroupWindow 2->1 dissolution) on Windows.

This is a local backport of the UPSTREAM fix that is on the qt/qtbase 6.11 branch
(heading to 6.11.2; also in 6.12) — verbatim. We independently root-caused + fixed it
the same way, then aligned to Qt's exact form. DROP this local patch once building
against Qt >= 6.11.2.

WHY (matches the upstream comment): QDockWidgetGroupWindow::reparentToMainWindow()
reparents the dock and mutates mwLayout->layoutState; the drag's savedState snapshot
SHARES QLayoutItem* with layoutState, so it goes stale. The nested setFloating() ->
QDockWidgetPrivate::endDrag() -> QMainWindowLayout::restore() then does
"layoutState = savedState" + applyState()/QDockAreaLayoutInfo::reparentWidgets(),
dereferencing a freed widgetItem -> access violation (qdockarealayout.cpp ~2210).
Clearing savedState up front (it only resets structure, does not delete the shared
items) makes restore() early-return. JV-confirmed on Windows 11 / Qt 6.11.1 / MSVC x64:
2->1 tear no longer crashes; create/move/3->2 unaffected. (A one-time repaint flash on
tear is inherent Qt reparent behaviour, present with or without this patch.)
Reported: https://forum.qt.io/topic/164810 (QTBUG-118579 family).
Re-apply after any qtbase source refresh (< 6.11.2), then rebuild+install.

--- a/src/widgets/widgets/qmainwindowlayout.cpp
+++ b/src/widgets/widgets/qmainwindowlayout.cpp
@@ void QDockWidgetGroupWindow::reparentToMainWindow(QDockWidget *dockWidget)
     mwLayout->widgetAnimator.abort(dockWidget);
+
+    // The saved state is now invalid because it contains
+    // a reference to the dock widget inside the group window.
+    // - the dock widget has been reparented.
+    // - if it was the last dock widget, the group window will be deleted
+    // => clear saved state.
+    mwLayout->savedState.clear();
     QDockAreaLayoutInfo &parentInfo = mwLayout->layoutState.dockAreaLayout.docks[layoutInfo()->dockPos];
     dockWidget->removeEventFilter(this);
     parentInfo.add(dockWidget);
     layoutInfo()->remove(dockWidget);
     const bool wasFloating = dockWidget->isFloating();
     const bool wasVisible = dockWidget->isVisible();
     dockWidget->setParent(mainWindow);
     dockWidget->setFloating(wasFloating);
     dockWidget->setVisible(wasVisible);
 }
